  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>What if your shoes could train your mind? Introducing the Nike Mind 001 Mule, a revolutionary blend of neuroscience and comfort designed to elevate your pregame ritual. Developed by Nike’s Mind Science Department, these mules feature 22 dynamic outsole nodes that gently press against your foot with every step and activate sensory areas of the brain. The knit tongue with breathable perforations keeps your feet cool and relaxed, so your mental warm-up feels as good as your physical one. Train your mind like you train your body and let every step sharpen your edge with the Nike Mind 001 Mule.</p> <p><strong>Nike Mind 001 Mule features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Soft foam in the midsole provides robust, comfortable cushioning.</li> <li>Stretchy fabric on the footbed gives the nodes room to move up and down.</li> <li>Rubber pods near the toe and heel help provide durable traction.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Pregame rituals just got smarter. The Nike Mind 001 Mule is built around a simple but bold idea: what if footwear could sharpen your focus before you even lace up? Developed by Nike's Mind Science Department, the Mind 001 features 22 dynamic outsole nodes that gently engage sensory areas of the foot with every step, creating a subtle feedback loop between body and mind. A soft foam midsole delivers plush, all-day cushioning, while a stretchy footbed fabric lets the nodes flex naturally underfoot. The knit tongue with breathable perforations keeps things cool and relaxed, rounding out a mule that's as intentional as your training.</p> <ul> <li>22 dynamic outsole nodes activate sensory areas of the foot for a unique, massage-like feel with each step</li> <li>Soft foam midsole provides robust, comfortable cushioning</li> <li>Stretchy footbed fabric allows nodes to move freely up and down underfoot</li> <li>Knit tongue with breathable perforations promotes airflow and all-day comfort</li> <li>Rubber pods near the toe and heel deliver durable traction</li> <li>Developed by Nike's Mind Science Department</li> </ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>The Mind 001 delivers a snug, close-to-foot feel. For the best fit, those with standard or narrower feet will find their true size works well. If you have a wider foot, we recommend sizing up half a size to ensure a comfortable, unrestricted fit throughout the toe box.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Perfect for athletes and everyday wearers who want to elevate their pregame ritual, recovery routine, or daily off-court comfort with a uniquely sensory slip-on.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p> <p>The Mind 001's sculptural silhouette and distinctive node outsole give it an unmistakable presence on and off the court. Its clean, minimal upper transitions effortlessly from locker-room warmups to casual everyday wear, making it a go-to slip-on whenever you want standout style and serious underfoot sensation in one package.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p> <p>Reviewers report wearing the Mind 001 daily with no drop-off in comfort or structure, and materials hold up well with regular use. The nodes stay soft and responsive over time, continuing to deliver that signature sensory feeling session after session.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Mind 001 Mule - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Hemp/Pale Ivory/Sanddrift</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>HQ4307-200</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 38.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-alig